Hello Gitesh



How are you, it is good to write again after a long time and just to start =
with formal introduction



Few Programs we do

1.      Lateral Hiring
2.      Fresher Hiring Model with Training
3.      Staffing, if required for temporary project execution
4.      Corporate Trainings to ensure current employees upskilling is done
5.      Transformation for matching the talent for adhering Vision and Miss=
ion of Company



Flagship Program (Apart from above more programs)

Orena Solutions brings a research-driven, plug-and-play campus model that b=
ridges the gap between academia and industry, ensuring freshers are product=
ive from Day 1 while significantly reducing internal training bandwidth and=
 ramp-up time.

Key Deliverables from Orena Solutions:

1. End-to-End Talent Sourcing & Assessment

*       Targeted campus hiring (ITI / Diploma / Engineering / Masters)
*       Structured aptitude and technical assessments
*       SME-led technical interviews ensuring quality filtration
*       Only top 5-10% candidates shortlisted for final deployment

2. Customized Finishing School (Pre-Joining Training)

*       Role-based training aligned to your JD.
*       Modules covering the need of JD
*       Eliminates typical 4-6 months of internal training effort

3. Industry-Aligned Curriculum Design

*       Courses designed jointly with company technical teams as well as tr=
aining being reviewed by Company teams
*       Specialized tracks for different modules, where needed.
*       Continuous evaluation through skill matrix and project-based assess=
ments

4. On-Ground Training & Deployment Model

*       Training delivered by industry experts, IIT SMEs, and domain specia=
lists
*       Mock interviews and readiness validation with company engineers
*       Seamless onboarding with immediate deploy ability

5. Scalable Hiring & Deployment Capability

*       Proven track record: 1,500+ engineers deployed with ~98% success ra=
te
*       Rapid scale-up: 500 engineers hired across multiple locations withi=
n 6 months
*       Capability to support PAN-India and global hiring needs

6. Research & Innovation Integration

*       20+ IPs developed and 1 patent registered
*       Collaboration with academia for labs, projects, and innovation pipe=
lines
*       Opportunity for Shloka Group to build long-term R&D capabilities al=
ongside hiring

7. Productivity & Cost Impact

*       Reduced cost-to-productivity
*       Faster shop-floor integration
*       Significant savings in senior engineering bandwidth through pre-vet=
ted talent

We would be happy to present a detailed implementation roadmap tailored to =
your company operations.

Request you to kindly share a convenient time for a discussion.

Regards





